    "description": "Each Attack win drains 20 HP from the enemy and heals Bloody Longinus the same amount, building a Bloody Squall stack (+10 ATK permanently, max 5). Every stack also loads Dragon Scream with +12 bonus damage — firing the Special spends them all. At 5 stacks BLOOD FRENZY erupts: guaranteed crits and defense pierce for 2 turns, but the open guard never closes — Longinus bleeds 15 recoil on every Attack win for the rest of the battle.",
